prompts.prompt:
Extract the following fields from this Argentine remito (delivery note)
and return ONLY a valid JSON object with this exact structure, no extra
text:

{
  "nro": "",
  "emisor": {
    "razon_social": "",
    "cuit": ""
  },
  "destinatario": {
    "nombre": "",
    "domicilio": "",
    "localidad": "",
    "cuit": "",
    "condicion_iva": ""
  },
  "transportista": {
    "nombre": "",
    "pat_chasis": "",
    "pat_acoplado": "",
    "chofer": ""
  },
  "detalle": [
    {
      "cantidad": 0,
      "descripcion": ""
    }
  ],
  "aclaracion": ""
}

This document may be a scanned image with OCR noise - do your best to read it. "nro" typically follows the format PV-NNNNN (e.g. 0006-00002179).
If a field is not present or illegible, use an empty string (or 0 for numeric fields). "detalle" must contain one object per line item.
